{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Torsion.antiparticle_crossing_reversal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Torsion.antiparticle_crossing_reversal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Shared.MarkovTraceClaim"],"declarations":21,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.antiparticle_crossing_reversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.antiparticle_crossing_reversal","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L63-L79","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $T_{2,3}$ be the left trefoil (the electron generator) and\n$T_{2,3}^{\\sigma}$ its mirror image (all crossings reversed).\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:antiparticle-crossing-reversal","label":"prop:antiparticle-crossing-reversal","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/antiparticle-crossing-reversal.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_topological_mass_invariance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_topological_mass_invariance","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (iv) — Topological mass invariance: the mirror\npreserves the knot type so `m_topological(𝔋^σ) = m_topological(𝔋)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_coulomb_charge_reversal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_coulomb_charge_reversal","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L57-L57","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (iii) — Coulomb charge reversal:\n`Q(𝔋^σ) = −Q(𝔋)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_crossing_energy_sign","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_crossing_energy_sign","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (ii) — Crossing energy sign reversal under\n`q ↔ q⁻¹`: `E_cross(𝔋^σ) = −E_cross(𝔋)|_{q ↔ q⁻¹}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_crossing_reversal_defines","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.impl_crossing_reversal_defines","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L48-L48","doc":"Manuscript sub-claim (i) — Crossing reversal defines the\nantihadron via the braid-mirror involution: `β_anti = mirror β`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.reversal_active","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.reversal_active","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Hypothesis that crossing reversal is active. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.crossing_reversal_holds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.crossing_reversal_holds","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L43-L43","doc":"Proposition: antiparticle crossing reversal holds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.m_topological_anti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.m_topological_anti","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.m_topological","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.m_topological","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Topological (relational) mass of a hadron and its antihadron.  This is\nthe *relational* mass — a knot-type invariant, not an archimedean MeV\nvalue — so it too lives in `R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.Q_charge_anti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.Q_charge_anti","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L36-L36","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.Q_charge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.Q_charge","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Coulomb charge of a hadron and its antihadron. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.mirror","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.mirror","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Mirror involution `σ ↦ σ⁻¹` on braids. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.β_anti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.β_anti","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L31-L31","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.β_hadron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.β_hadron","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L30-L30","doc":"Braid representative of a hadron and its mirror image. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.Braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.Braid","kind":"def","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L28-L28","doc":"Braid type (for the mirror operation). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.E_cross_bar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.E_cross_bar","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L26-L26","doc":"Crossing energy evaluated under `q ↔ q⁻¹` swap. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.E_cross_anti","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.E_cross_anti","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L24-L24","doc":"Crossing energy of the corresponding antihadron. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.E_cross","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.E_cross","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L22-L22","doc":"Crossing energy of a hadron, valued in the inherited coefficient ring\n`R` of the parent Markov-trace context: the crossing energy is read off\nthe Hecke crossing coefficients, so it is a Laurent expression in `q`\nand the bar-involution `q ↔ q⁻¹` acts on it inside `R`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L17-L17","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.toMarkovTraceContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext.toMarkovTraceContext","kind":"def","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L17-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.AntiparticleCrossingReversalContext","kind":"class","line":15,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Torsion/antiparticle_crossing_reversal.lean#L15-L61","doc":"Abstract context for the `antiparticle_crossing_reversal` claim — manuscript-themed\ntyped fields below; `holds` carries the residual `Prop` claim. ","signatureChunk":0}]}